      "Section": "People",
      "Anchor": "people",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "The People API returns a member\u0027s LinkedIn profile, subject to the member\u0027s privacy settings.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "People",
      "Anchor": "people",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "The service currently provides the following methods:",
