      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Get Profile",
      "Anchor": "get-profile",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Get Profile"
      ],
      "Text": "This method allows for fetching a single LinkedIn member profile given a person id.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Sample Request",
      "Anchor": "sample-request",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Get Profile",
        "Sample Request"
      ],
      "Text": "http\n\n\ncurl",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "code",
      "Section": "Sample Request",
      "Anchor": "sample-request",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Get Profile",
        "Sample Request"
      ],
      "Text": "GET https://api.linkedin.com/rest/dmaPeople/(id:123)?fields=id,firstName,lastName,maidenName,localizedFirstName,localizedLastName,localizedMaidenName,vanityName,headline,localizedHeadline,profilePicture",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "code",
      "Section": "Sample Request",
      "Anchor": "sample-request",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Get Profile",
        "Sample Request"
      ],
      "Text": "curl -X GET \u0027https://api.linkedin.com/rest/dmaPeople/(id:123)?fields=id,firstName,lastName,maidenName,localizedFirstName,localizedLastName,localizedMaidenName,vanityName,headline,localizedHeadline,profilePicture\u0027 \\\n--header \u0027Authorization: Bearer {INSERT_TOKEN}\u0027 \\\n--header \u0027Linkedin-Version: {version number in the format YYYYMM}\u0027 \\\n--header \u0027X-Restli-Protocol-Version: 2.0.0\u0027",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "code",
      "Section": "Sample Response",
      "Anchor": "sample-response",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Get Profile",
        "Sample Response"
      ],
      "Text": "{\n    \u0022id\u0022: \u0022123\u0022,\n    \u0022firstName\u0022: {\n        \u0022localized\u0022: {\n            \u0022en_US\u0022: \u0022MyFirstName\u0022\n        },\n        \u0022preferredLocale\u0022: {\n            \u0022country\u0022: \u0022US\u0022,\n            \u0022language\u0022: \u0022en\u0022\n        }\n    },\n    \u0022localizedFirstName\u0022: \u0022MyFirstName\u0022,\n    \u0022lastName\u0022: {\n        \u0022localized\u0022: {\n            \u0022en_US\u0022: \u0022MyLastName\u0022\n        },\n        \u0022preferredLocale\u0022: {\n            \u0022country\u0022: \u0022US\u0022,\n            \u0022language\u0022: \u0022en\u0022\n        }\n    },\n    \u0022localizedLastName\u0022: \u0022MyLastName\u0022,\n    \u0022maidenName\u0022: {\n        \u0022localized\u0022: {\n            \u0022en_US\u0022: \u0022MyMaidenName\u0022\n        },\n        \u0022preferredLocale\u0022: {\n            \u0022country\u0022: \u0022US\u0022,\n            \u0022language\u0022: \u0022en\u0022\n        }\n    },\n    \u0022localizedMaidenName\u0022: \u0022MyMaidenName\u0022,\n    \u0022headline\u0022: {\n        \u0022localized\u0022: {\n            \u0022en_US\u0022: \u0022This is my headline\u0022\n        },\n        \u0022preferredLocale\u0022: {\n            \u0022country\u0022: \u0022US\u0022,\n            \u0022language\u0022: \u0022en\u0022\n        }\n    },\n    \u0022localizedHeadline\u0022: \u0022This is my headline\u0022,\n    \u0022vanityName\u0022: \u0022myVanityName\u0022,\n    \u0022profilePicture\u0022: {\n        \u0022displayImage\u0022: {\n            \u0022downloadUrl\u0022: \u0022https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/D4E03AQEqeCvWIJKq4g/profile-displayphoto-shrink_400_400/0/1675118916417?e=1705536000\u0026v=beta\u0026t=Mdj0dzluNN0mEVlNZT0XBSNlKif7ZMcXAn1eJX3YPpE\u0022,\n            \u0022downloadUrlExpiresAt\u0022: 1705536000000,\n            \u0022status\u0022: \u0022AVAILABLE\u0022\n        }\n    }\n}",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Batch Get Profile",
      "Anchor": "batch-get-profile",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Batch Get Profile"
      ],
      "Text": "This method allows for fetching multiple LinkedIn member profiles given person ids.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Sample Request",
      "Anchor": "sample-request-1",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Batch Get Profile",
        "Sample Request"
      ],
      "Text": "http\n\n\ncurl",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "code",
      "Section": "Sample Request",
      "Anchor": "sample-request-1",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Batch Get Profile",
        "Sample Request"
      ],
      "Text": "GET https://api.linkedin.com/rest/dmaPeople?ids=List((id:123),(id:456))\u0026fields=id,firstName,lastName,maidenName,localizedFirstName,localizedLastName,localizedMaidenName,vanityName,headline,localizedHeadline,profilePicture",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "code",
      "Section": "Sample Request",
      "Anchor": "sample-request-1",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Batch Get Profile",
        "Sample Request"
      ],
      "Text": "curl -X GET \u0027https://api.linkedin.com/rest/dmaPeople?ids=List((id:123),(id:456))\u0026fields=id,firstName,lastName,maidenName,localizedFirstName,localizedLastName,localizedMaidenName,vanityName,headline,localizedHeadline,profilePicture\u0027 \\\n--header \u0027Authorization: Bearer {INSERT_TOKEN}\u0027 \\\n--header \u0027Linkedin-Version: {version number in the format YYYYMM}\u0027 \\\n--header \u0027X-Restli-Protocol-Version: 2.0.0\u0027",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Sample Response",
      "Anchor": "sample-response-1",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Batch Get Profile",
        "Sample Response"
      ],
      "Text": "In this example, first member is opted into new DMA setting (and hence member data is returned) and second member is opted out (and hence member data is obfuscated)",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "code",
      "Section": "Sample Response",
      "Anchor": "sample-response-1",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Batch Get Profile",
        "Sample Response"
      ],
      "Text": "{\n    \u0022results\u0022: {\n        \u0022(id:123)\u0022: {\n            \u0022id\u0022: \u0022123\u0022,\n            \u0022firstName\u0022: {\n                \u0022localized\u0022: {\n                    \u0022en_US\u0022: \u0022MyFirstName\u0022\n                },\n                \u0022preferredLocale\u0022: {\n                    \u0022country\u0022: \u0022US\u0022,\n                    \u0022language\u0022: \u0022en\u0022\n                }\n            },\n            \u0022localizedFirstName\u0022: \u0022MyFirstName\u0022,\n            \u0022lastName\u0022: {\n                \u0022localized\u0022: {\n                    \u0022en_US\u0022: \u0022MyLastName\u0022\n                },\n                \u0022preferredLocale\u0022: {\n                    \u0022country\u0022: \u0022US\u0022,\n                    \u0022language\u0022: \u0022en\u0022\n                }\n            },\n            \u0022localizedLastName\u0022: \u0022MyLastName\u0022,\n            \u0022maidenName\u0022: {\n                \u0022localized\u0022: {\n                    \u0022en_US\u0022: \u0022MyMaidenName\u0022\n                },\n                \u0022preferredLocale\u0022: {\n                    \u0022country\u0022: \u0022US\u0022,\n                    \u0022language\u0022: \u0022en\u0022\n                }\n            },\n            \u0022localizedMaidenName\u0022: \u0022MyMaidenName\u0022,\n            \u0022headline\u0022: {\n                \u0022localized\u0022: {\n                    \u0022en_US\u0022: \u0022This is my headline\u0022\n                },\n                \u0022preferredLocale\u0022: {\n                    \u0022country\u0022: \u0022US\u0022,\n                    \u0022language\u0022: \u0022en\u0022\n                }\n            },\n            \u0022localizedHeadline\u0022: \u0022This is my headline\u0022,\n            \u0022vanityName\u0022: \u0022myVanityName\u0022,\n            \u0022profilePicture\u0022: {\n                \u0022displayImage\u0022: {\n                    \u0022downloadUrl\u0022: \u0022https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/D4E03AQEqeCvWIJKq4g/profile-displayphoto-shrink_400_400/0/1675118916417?e=1705536000\u0026v=beta\u0026t=Mdj0dzluNN0mEVlNZT0XBSNlKif7ZMcXAn1eJX3YPpE\u0022,\n                    \u0022downloadUrlExpiresAt\u0022: 1705536000000,\n                    \u0022status\u0022: \u0022AVAILABLE\u0022\n                }\n            }\n        },\n        \u0022(id:456)\u0022: {\n            \u0022id\u0022: \u0022private\u0022\n        }\n    }\n}",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
